{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2021-05-10 09:23:00', 'title': "KEYBANK RANKED #23 ON DIVERSITYINC'S 2021 TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY", 'text': 'CLEVELAND, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN RECOGNITION OF ITS CONTINUED COMMITMENT TO AND ADVANCEMENT OF DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION PRACTICES, KEYBANK (NYSE: KEY)\xa0HAS EARNED THE #23 PLACE ON THE 2021\xa0DIVERSITYINC "TOP 50 COMPANIES FOR DIVERSITY"\xa0LIST, IMPROVING 12 SPOTS FROM #35 IN 2020. THIS YEAR\'S RECOGNITION MARKS THE TWELFTH TIME AND EIGHTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR KEYBANK WAS NAMED A TOP 50 COMPANY.'}